      "features": [
        "Fuzzy Round Ball Design:Featuring a soft fuzzy texture and a round egg-shaped design, this stress ball is compact and lightweight, easily fitting into a pocket or bag. Whether at home, in the office, or while traveling, it helps relieve stress anytime, anywhere. It retains its original shape even after repeated squeezing, offering lasting elasticity and responsive recovery.",
        "Creative Gift:Looking for a special and thoughtful gift? This colorful egg-shaped fuzz squishy with a cheerful smiley face is an ideal choice for colleagues, students, friends, or family. Whether for a birthday, holiday, or just to show you care, it brings a fun and delightful surprise.",
        "Soft Fuzzy Texture Delightful Sensory Experience:Uniquely designed in a colorful egg shape with a soft fuzzy exterior and a playful smiley face, this squeeze toys delivers a satisfying sensory experience with every squeeze. The cheerful design adds visual appeal, while the soft touch makes each squeeze comforting and stress-relieving.",
        "Comfortable Stress Relief :Made with a soft yet resilient material, this fidget toy provides pleasing sensory feedback when squeezed, helping to calm emotions and improve focus. Regular squeezing also helps increase hand flexibility and relieve joint pain, making it ideal for daily relaxation and gentle hand therapy.",
        "Safe Material Durability:Made from high-quality, non-toxic materials, this product is soft yet durable. It maintains its shape even after repeated use, ensuring long-lasting companionship and a worry-free experience for users of all ages."
      ],
